  "description": "The current test\u2011execution configuration is defined for version\u202f1.0.0. At the top level the sequence begins with the CAPL test case **TC_InitSystem** (ID\u202fTC001), titled \u201cInitialize System\u201d, which resets and initializes the ECU. This case is invoked with the parameters\u202f0 and the string \u201cfast\u201d. Immediately after, the test tree calls the CAPL test sequence **Seq_RunDiagnostics**, labeled \u201cDiagnostics Sequence\u201d, using the parameters\u202f1 and \u201cfull\u201d.\n\nFollowing these standalone items, the tree enters **Group_A**, a test group described as \u201cSubsystem\u202fA tests\u201d. Inside this group the first element is the CAPL test case **TC_CheckVoltage** (ID\u202fTC002) titled \u201cCheck Voltage\u201d, supplied with the single numeric parameter\u202f12.5. The group also contains a nested subgroup named **Subgroup_A1**; within this subgroup the only element is the CAPL test sequence **Seq_SubTest**, which runs with the parameters the string \u201csub\u201d and the number\u202f42.",
  "reference_json": {
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "test-tree": [
      {
        "capl-test-case": "TC_InitSystem",
        "id": "TC001",
        "title": "Initialize System",
        "description": "Resets and initializes the ECU.",
        "params": [
          0,
          "fast"
        ]
      },
      {
        "capl-test-sequence": "Seq_RunDiagnostics",
        "title": "Diagnostics Sequence",
        "params": [
          1,
          "full"
        ]
      },
      {
        "test-group": "Group_A",
        "description": "Subsystem A tests",
        "elements": [
          {
            "capl-test-case": "TC_CheckVoltage",
            "id": "TC002",
            "title": "Check Voltage",
            "params": [
              12.5
            ]
          },
          {
            "test-group": "Subgroup_A1",
            "elements": [
              {
                "capl-test-sequence": "Seq_SubTest",
                "params": [
                  "sub",
                  42
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
